## Proposed Changes

### Domain Layer

#### [MODIFY] [ProrationCalculatorService.cs](file:///c:/Users/Mhamed/source/repos/Backend%20Projects/enforcer/backend/src/Modules/Billings/Enforcer.Modules.Billings.Domain/Services/ProrationCalculatorService.cs)
- Already moved to Domain in a prior step. No changes needed — this is pure math.

---

### Infrastructure Layer

#### [NEW] `Invoicing/ILineItemContributor.cs`
```csharp
public interface ILineItemContributor
{
    InvoiceLineItem? Contribute();
}
```
A single-method interface. Each implementation returns one line item (or `null` to skip).

---

#### [NEW] `Invoicing/Contributors/SubscriptionContributor.cs`
- Adds the base subscription charge: `"{PlanName} - Subscription"` or `"{PlanName} - Renewal"`.

#### [NEW] `Invoicing/Contributors/OverageContributor.cs`
- Adds overage charges if `OverageUsed > 0` and plan has `OveragePriceInCents`.

#### [NEW] `Invoicing/Contributors/ProratedSubscriptionContributor.cs`
- Uses [ProrationCalculatorService](file:///c:/Users/Mhamed/source/repos/Backend%20Projects/enforcer/backend/src/Modules/Billings/Enforcer.Modules.Billings.Infrastructure/Services/ProrationCalculatorService.cs#3-45) to calculate prorated charge for a new plan.

#### [NEW] `Invoicing/Contributors/CreditForUnusedTimeContributor.cs`
- Uses [ProrationCalculatorService](file:///c:/Users/Mhamed/source/repos/Backend%20Projects/enforcer/backend/src/Modules/Billings/Enforcer.Modules.Billings.Infrastructure/Services/ProrationCalculatorService.cs#3-45) to calculate credit for unused time on current plan.

#### [NEW] `Invoicing/Contributors/FullPriceSubscriptionContributor.cs`
- Adds the full-price charge when switching billing periods (e.g., Monthly → Yearly).

---

#### [NEW] `Invoicing/InvoiceBuilder.cs`
```csharp
public sealed class InvoiceBuilder
{
    private readonly Invoice _invoice;
    private readonly List<ILineItemContributor> _contributors = [];

    internal InvoiceBuilder(Invoice invoice) => _invoice = invoice;

    public InvoiceBuilder AddContribution(ILineItemContributor contributor)
    {
        _contributors.Add(contributor);
        return this;
    }

    public Invoice Build()
    {
        foreach (var contributor in _contributors)
        {
            var lineItem = contributor.Contribute();
            if (lineItem is not null)
                _invoice.AddLineItem(lineItem);
        }
        return _invoice;
    }
}
```

#### [NEW] `Invoicing/InvoiceFactory.cs`
```csharp
public static class InvoiceFactory
{
    public static InvoiceBuilder Create(
        Guid consumerId, string currency,
        Guid? subscriptionId = null,
        DateTime? periodStart = null, DateTime? periodEnd = null,
        string? notes = null)
    {
        var invoice = Invoice.Create(consumerId, currency, subscriptionId,
            periodStart, periodEnd, notes);
        return new InvoiceBuilder(invoice);
    }
}
```

