## Result

After refactoring, the invoice system will be:

| Property | Before | After |
|---|---|---|
| **Centralized** | 3 separate files with inline logic | 1 Factory + reusable Contributors |
| **Flexible** | Adding a new line item type = editing a service | Adding a new line item type = 1 new Contributor class |
| **Readable** | Logic buried in nested `if` blocks | Each Contributor has a single, clear responsibility |
| **Reusable** | `OverageContributor` logic duplicated in 2 places | 1 `OverageContributor` used everywhere |

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Trace each scenario (Subscribe, Renew, PlanSwitch) to confirm the same line items are generated.
- Verify that the [PlanSwitchBillingService](file:///c:/Users/Mhamed/source/repos/Backend%20Projects/enforcer/backend/src/Modules/Billings/Enforcer.Modules.Billings.Infrastructure/Services/PlanSwitchBillingService.cs#15-63) correctly selects contributors based on the transition type.
